	PlutoniumQuarterstaff: {
		DisplayName: The Big A-Bomb
		Tooltip:
			'''
			Alternates between an upward swing, a downward swing, and a thrust upon jabbing
			Inflicts Critical Radiation Sickness on hit
			Builds up a charge meter on hit
			At full charge, swinging will eject the warhead from the tip
			The warhead explodes after 5 seconds, or upon contact
			Shooting the warhead with a bullet or laser will detonate it early
			Hitting the warhead midair with a warhammer or Impact Hammer spikes it in the direction of the cursor,
